---
# Keel sources, not C++. `.vscode/settings.json` maps `*.kl` to `cpp` for highlighting, which also
# hands them to clang-format on save - and it reformats them as C++: `fn( i32 ) -> i32` loses the
# spaces around the arrow, and a one-line fixture body gets split over four. The fixtures are read
# by people and diffed against expectations, so their layout is theirs. Nothing under here is C or
# C++: the unit tests live inside the sources they test.
DisableFormat: true
SortIncludes: Never
